<title>GERMANY: W.German prelim April CPI falls 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>W.German prelim April CPI falls 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PRELIM W.GERMAN INFLATION    Apr 96	   Mar 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)   -0.1	     -0.1</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (pct)	   +1.4	     +1.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		  n/a	    115.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The data are provisional. The Statistics Office said it would publish final figures in mid-May.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
